name exam-randomizechoices
category Package
revision 61719
shortdesc Randomize mc choices using the exam class
relocated 1
longdesc This package is an extension to the exam document class. It
longdesc provides the user with four new multiple choice typesetting
longdesc environments which place their content in a random order. It
longdesc can (only) be used in combination with the exam class. It can
longdesc only randomize the placement of choices in multiple choice
longdesc questions. The questions themselves cannot be randomized with
longdesc this package. Furthermore, the package provides a simple answer
longdesc key table typesetter and has a command for writing the answer
longdesc keys to an external file.
runfiles size=6
 RELOC/tex/latex/exam-randomizechoices/exam-randomizechoices.sty
catalogue-also exam
catalogue-contact-repository https://github.com/jesseopdenbrouw/exam-randomizechoices
